    <briefdescription>
<para>Namespace wrapper macros for Unity build consistency. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When MSVC_UNITY_BUILD=ON, all themis_graph sources are concatenated into a single compilation unit. To maintain namespace consistency across all 21 files:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>File 1 (ai_hardware_dispatcher.cpp): Opens <ref refid="namespace__config_8h_1a7bd1027512e4fd48c1505a90eca93fe2" kindref="member">THEMIS_NS_OPEN()</ref></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Files 2-20: Use NO namespace macros (implicit inheritance from File 1)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>File 21 (<ref refid="graph__query__rewriter_8cpp" kindref="compound">graph_query_rewriter.cpp</ref>): Closes <ref refid="namespace__config_8h_1a9d5931ea794ab1923460b3763def9fcd" kindref="member">THEMIS_NS_CLOSE()</ref></para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Each file still includes their own headers which may be in different namespaces for standalone compilation, but the macro wrapper ensures Unity mode consistency. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
